config SRAM_BUFFER_SIZE
    int "Raw audio capture buffer size (bytes)"
    default 102400
    help
      Size of the buffer CONFIG_AUDIO_CAPTURE_TEST captures raw PCM into before
      dumping it over UART. Allocated only when that option is enabled. The BLE
      model transfer no longer shares it: it stages one flash sector, sized by
      MODEL_TRANSFER_BLOCK_SIZE in ble_services/file_transfer.h.
	  
