      This enables AUDIO.
	  
config AUDIO_DMIC
    bool "Enable DMIC"
    default n
    help
      This enables DMIC.

config AUDIO_BLOCK_MS
    int "Audio DMA block size (ms)"
    default 60
    help
      Default PDM capture block size in milliseconds. Must be a multiple of the
      MFCC hop (CONFIG_MFCC_SAMPLE_COUNT samples = 20 ms at 16 kHz) so MFCC
      framing stays aligned, and no larger than CONFIG_AUDIO_MAX_BLOCK_MS.
      Runtime-adjustable via the `app blkms` shell command. Smaller = lower
      latency but a faster capture cadence.

config AUDIO_MAX_BLOCK_MS
    int "Maximum audio DMA block size (ms)"
    default 80
    help
      Upper bound for the audio block size. The DMA mem-slab and the audio
      processing buffers are statically sized for this value, so a runtime
      `app blkms` change can never overrun them. Must be a multiple of 20.

config SYNC_MODE
    int "Enable Akida Sync"
    default 0
    help
      This enables Akida Sync.	  
	  
